DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sei immer schön fleißig,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
dann verleihe ich dir ein
neues Abzeichen!

IT:
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}} Ehi ehi, tigrott{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Ti ho dato tutti i distintivi possibili
e immaginabili!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sono semplicemente sbalordito!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Hai fatto davvero un ottimo lavoro
e hai reso questo vecchio leone
marino fiero di te!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Spero che tutte queste esperienze{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}ti abbiano rinforzat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Se ti senti giù di morale,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} guarda
tutti i distintivi che hai guadagnato{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
e ricordati cosa sei in grado di fare!

EN:
Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} good morning to you, youngster!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ahh, the morning breeze in the
forest is most agreeable today.

IT:
Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} buongiorno, tigrott{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ahhh, non c'è niente di meglio
della rugiada mattutina del bosco!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Günaydın, genç dostum!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Ormandaki sabah esintisi bugün
pek hoş.

EN:
Why,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} good afternoon, youngster.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ahh, I do so love to feel the sunlight
streaming through the trees.

IT:
Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} salve, tigrott{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ahhh, adoro vedere la luce
del sole che filtra tra gli alberi.

TRANSLATION:
İyi {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} günler, genç dostum. {{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Ağaçların arasından süzülen
güneş ışığını hissetmeye bayılırım.

EN:
Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} and good day to you, youngster.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Wouldn't you say this is the perfect
time for a stroll?

IT:
Ehi ehi,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} salve a te, tigrott{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Adoro fare lunghe passeggiate{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
a quest'ora. Lo trovo rigenerante!

EN:
Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} hello there, youngster.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I find the stillness of the night
to be quite calming.

IT:
Ehilà,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} come andiamo tigrott{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Non trovi anche tu che questa
quiete notturna sia rilassante?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, yes,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} what can I do for you?{{TAG:000F:0005:00002800}}
I want another badge!
Nothing.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Hola de nuevo!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} ¿Querías algo?{{TAG:000F:0005:00002800}}
¡Sí, otra insignia!
No, nada

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oui ?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Que puis-je faire pour toi ?{{TAG:000F:0005:00002800}}
Un autre badge !
Rien.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, bene,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} cosa posso fare per te?{{TAG:000F:0005:00002800}}
Un altro distintivo!
Niente.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, ja,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} wie kann ich dir denn helfen?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Noch ein Abzeichen!
Ach, nichts...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aa, evet,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} senin için ne yapabilirim?{{TAG:000F:0005:00002800}}
Bir rozet daha istiyorum!
Hiçbir şey.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Estarás content{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}, ¿eh? ¡No todo
el mundo recibe una como esa!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
¡Cuídala bien y lúcela con orgullo!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu ihtiyarı çok mutlu ettin! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Rozet koleksiyonunu tamamlamak
gerçekten büyük başarı!
